    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 38"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Prayer of a Suffering Penitent."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Psalm of David, for a memorial."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, do not rebuke me in Your wrath,",
          "And do not punish me in Your burning anger."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For Your arrows have sunk deep into me,",
          "And Your hand has pressed down on me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There is no healthy part in my flesh because of Your indignation;",
          "There is no health in my bones because of my sin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For my guilty deeds have gone over my head;",
          "Like a heavy burden they weigh too much for me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My wounds grow foul and fester",
          "Because of my foolishness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I am bent over and greatly bowed down;",
          "I go in mourning all day long."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For my sides are filled with burning,",
          "And there is no healthy part in my flesh."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I feel faint and badly crushed;",
          "I groan because of the agitation of my heart."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Lord, all my desire is before You;",
          "And my sighing is not hidden from You."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart throbs, my strength fails me;",
          "And the light of my eyes, even that has gone from me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My loved ones and my friends stand aloof from my plague;",
          "And my kinsmen stand far away."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Those who seek my life lay snares for me;",
          "And those who seek to injure me have threatened destruction,",
          "And they plot deception all day long."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶But I, like a person who is deaf, do not hear;",
          "And I am like a person who cannot speak, who does not open his mouth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Yes, I am like a person who does not hear,",
          "And in whose mouth are no arguments."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For I wait for You, Lord;",
          "You will answer, Lord my God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For I said, “May they not rejoice over me,",
          "Who, when my foot slips, would exalt themselves over me.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For I am ready to fall,",
          "And my sorrow is continually before me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For I admit my guilt;",
          "I am full of anxiety because of my sin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But my enemies are vigorous and strong,",
          "And those who wrongfully hate me are many."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And those who repay evil for good,",
          "They become my enemies, because I follow what is good."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not abandon me, Lord;",
          "My God, do not be far from me!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hurry to help me,",
          "Lord, my salvation!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
